            Mirrormont is a well-established residential community situated on the forested hillsides south of central Issaquah. Developed primarily during the 1970s through the early 2000s, the neighborhood features a mix of ranch homes, split-level designs, and traditional two-story family residences set among tall evergreen trees on generous lots.
          </p>
