            Heavy-duty 48-amp charging repairs providing reliable overnight range for rural commutes.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>


        <h2>Why Mirrormont Homeowners Choose Us</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Established Home Expertise:</strong> We work with every panel brand and vintage found in Mirrormont, from legacy manufacturers through modern equipment.</li>
          <li><strong>Multi-Level Construction Skills:</strong> We plan conduit routes for split-level and hillside homes that minimize wall penetrations and aesthetic impact.</li>
          <li><strong>Surge Protection Advocacy:</strong> We recommend SPDs for all overhead-fed Mirrormont homes, protecting charging equipment from power quality events.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Proximity:</strong> Our 612 Jasmine Pl NW office is a short drive from Mirrormont for both scheduled and urgent service calls.</li>
          <li><strong>Straightforward Assessments:</strong> We tell you exactly what your home needs—whether a simple circuit addition or a panel upgrade—and explain the reasoning behind every recommendation.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Our Service Process</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Phone Assessment:</strong> We collect your home's approximate age, panel location, garage configuration, vehicle model, and any existing electrical concerns.</li>
          <li><strong>On-Site Survey:</strong> Our electrician inspects the panel, evaluates conduit routing options, and performs load calculations specific to your home.</li>
          <li><strong>Professional repair:</strong> We install the circuit, mount the charger, connect everything to code, and coordinate any required city inspection.</li>
          <li><strong>Live Testing:</strong> We verify charging under load with your vehicle, check voltage stability, and confirm proper operation before completing the project.</li>
        </ol>

        <p>
          Call <a href="tel:+14253800019">(425) 380-0019</a> to discuss your Mirrormont EV charger project. We understand the electrical character of this community and design every repair for long-term reliability.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

